## crew-guest shares the job VM's vCPUs with the job (§13.5): one
## scheduler, one async thread, and no scheduler busy-waiting, dirty
## schedulers included.
+S 1:1
+A 1
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
## crew-guest stops the job itself (at most 11 s after SIGTERM) and only
## then the release: init:stop gets 2 s before init kills what's left,
## which keeps all of it under the unit's TimeoutStopSec (15 s).
-shutdown_time 2000
